---
title: Gingerbread
author: Mildred McKinzie
category: Desserts
cook time: 30 minutes
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@shortening{0.5%cup}
@sugar{0.5%cup}
@egg{1}
@molasses{0.5%cup}
@ginger{0.5%tsp}
@boiling water{0.5%cup}
@baking soda{1%tsp}
@flour{1.5%cups}

Mix shortening, sugar, egg, molasses and ginger. Mix boiling water and soda. Add to first mixture and stir in flour. Bake in a 9 inch square pan at 350 degrees for about 30 minutes, until top springs back when touched. Serve with whipped cream or lemon sauce.
